                "(8989 dashboard / 8990 instmon / 9997 44helper / 9999 sysmon -- i.e. what is even available to "
                "expose), and the WireGuard coexistence verdict: clean if there is no tunnel or a split tunnel; a "
                "prominent WARN under a full tunnel (AllowedIPs=0.0.0.0/0), where cloudflared's edge connection "
                "(7844/udp) rides wg0 through the 44Net gateway.",
